Z||000000||JasonJ||08-04-2001||08:14 PM||||Hi everyone! Yes, im new to Fiero's and to this forum. So please excuse me if this is a silly question. I need a passenger side fender, front fascia cover thingy, complete pass. side headlight assembly, and a hood for my 86GT. It is a beautiful car with only 54K miles on it, but my girlfriend likes to run up under Ford Explorers while driving it! I need to know if i can get these parts off of any year/model of Fiero to fit my 86GT? I pretty much figured out that ALL fenders are the same except for drilling 2 small holes for the ground effects. So will ANY Fiero hood and aerocoupe front end fit my 86? Any help would be greatly appreciated!<P>------------------<BR>86 GT||||reg||7
Z||000001||Songman||08-04-2001||08:37 PM||||Yes, all hoods are the same, as are front fascias I believe (except for the molding). The headlight mechanism is different on later years than earlier years. They will all bolt up, but the later ones are better. 84-86 are the same, and 87-88 are the same...||||reg||1
